WEBVTT

00:08:58.097 --> 00:09:01.663
This is about more
than windmills and solar panels.

00:09:01.697 --> 00:09:07.497
Community energy can help overcome
the urban and rural divide

00:09:07.530 --> 00:09:10.430
and close the gap between north and south,

00:09:10.463 --> 00:09:12.330
between rich and poor,

00:09:12.363 --> 00:09:14.830
because it empowers local people.

00:09:15.330 --> 00:09:19.463
Community energy
leads to energy democracy,

00:09:19.497 --> 00:09:23.663
holding the promise
of an economy and a society

00:09:23.663 --> 00:09:26.963
based on cooperation
rather than competition

00:09:26.997 --> 00:09:29.763
within the boundaries of planet Earth.